---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Img from '../../components/Img.astro';
import '../../styles/service.css';
import '../../styles/pages/services.css';
---

<Base title="Studio Béa — Services" active="services">
<!-- INTRO -->
<section class="grid-brown dark sv-hero" style="position:relative;padding:80px 0 104px;color:#F7F0DC">
  <div class="wrap sv-hero-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(460px,100%),1fr));gap:64px;align-items:center">
    <div style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
      <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Fil d'Ariane" style="color:#F3E9B5"><a href="/" style="color:#F3E9B5">Accueil</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Services</span></nav>
      <div style="position:relative">
        <h1 class="h1" style="color:#F7F0DC">Mes services</h1>
        <span class="script sv-pourvous" data-anim="write" aria-hidden="true" style="--d:.5s;position:absolute;left:450px;bottom:-22px;font-size:76px;color:#F3E9B5;transform:rotate(-7deg);white-space:nowrap">pour vous</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lead sv-lead" style="max-width:600px;color:#F7F0DC">Cinq dossiers pour couvrir tout ce dont votre communication a besoin, de la stratégie à la création. Vous pouvez en ouvrir un seul… ou les combiner.</p>
      <nav class="sv-pills" aria-label="Aller à un service" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:8px">
        <a class="pill" href="#cm" style="background:#F2E3A0">01 · CM</a>
        <a class="pill" href="#audit" style="background:#C9D6EC">02 · Audit</a>
        <a class="pill" href="#graphisme" style="background:#EFC9D2">03 · Graphisme</a>
        <a class="pill" href="#redac" style="background:#CFE3C4"><span class="d-only">04 · Rédactionnel</span><span class="m-only">04 · Rédac</span></a>
        <a class="pill" href="#ugc" style="background:#F4D3B8">05 · UGC</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div style="position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center">
      <div class="postit sv-postit" data-anim="stick" style="--d:.6s;position:relative;width:340px;padding:44px 32px 30px;transform:rotate(3deg);color:#4A2018;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
        <div class="washi washi-dots" style="width:110px;top:-15px;left:50%;margin-left:-55px;transform:rotate(-4deg)"></div>
        <p class="note" style="font-size:30px;line-height:1.2">Pas certain du dossier à ouvrir ?</p>
        <p class="small">Racontez-moi votre projet, je vous oriente vers ce qui vous sera vraiment utile.</p>
        <a class="link" href="/contact/">M'écrire →</a>
      </div>
      <svg class="d-only twinkle" style="position:absolute;left:40px;bottom:-30px" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1.6l2.9 6.5 7.1.8-5.3 4.8 1.5 7-6.2-3.6-6.2 3.6 1.5-7L2 8.9l7.1-.8z" fill="#C9A43A"></path></svg>
      <svg class="d-only" style="position:absolute;right:40px;bottom:-40px;transform:rotate(14deg)" width="110" height="110" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><pattern id="pdSv" width="1.6" height="1.6" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx=".8" cy=".8" r=".38" fill="#4A2018"></circle></pattern></defs><path d="M12 1.6l2.9 6.5 7.1.8-5.3 4.8 1.5 7-6.2-3.6-6.2 3.6 1.5-7L2 8.9l7.1-.8z" fill="#FFFDF6" stroke="#4A2018" stroke-width=".3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 1.6l2.9 6.5 7.1.8-5.3 4.8 1.5 7-6.2-3.6-6.2 3.6 1.5-7L2 8.9l7.1-.8z" fill="url(#pdSv)"></path></svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LES 5 DOSSIERS -->
<section class="grid-cream sv-dossiers" style="position:relative;padding:110px 0 60px">
  <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:84px">
    <div class="m-only sv-mobile">
      <p class="label">— Les 5 dossiers</p>
      <div style="margin-top:22px" data-accordion="always" data-stagger="120ms">
      <details class="mfolder" id="m-cm" data-dossier="cm" open data-anim="rise">
        <summary>
          <span class="ear dots" style="left:0px;background-color:#F2E3A0">01 · CM</span>
          <span class="bar dots" style="background-color:#F2E3A0"><span class="h3" style="font-size:20px">Community management</span><svg class="chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6 L8 11 L13 6" fill="none" stroke="#4A2018" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mbody dots" style="background-color:#F2E3A0">
          <div class="sheet" style="gap:12px;padding-bottom:16px">
            <p class="small">Je prends en main vos réseaux sociaux : une ligne éditoriale claire, des contenus qui vous ressemblent et un suivi régulier.</p>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Ce que je fais</p>
            <ul class="stars-list"><li>Stratégie éditoriale</li><li>Création de contenus</li><li>Reporting</li></ul>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Idéal si…</p>
            <p class="note" style="font-size:20px">vous n'avez pas le temps de publier régulièrement</p>
            <div style="align-self:flex-start;filter:drop-shadow(3px 4px 0 rgba(74,32,24,.18));transform:rotate(-2deg);margin:4px 0 6px"><div class="ptag kraft"><span class="tag-hole"></span><span class="spec" style="font-weight:700">à partir de</span><span class="serif" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.1">200 € <span style="font-size:14px">/ mois</span></span></div></div>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services/community-management/">Découvrir le service</a>
            <a class="link" href="/portfolio/" style="font-size:12px">Voir les projets →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="mfolder" id="m-audit" data-dossier="audit" data-anim="rise">
        <summary>
          <span class="ear dots" style="left:46px;background-color:#C9D6EC">02 · Audit</span>
          <span class="bar dots" style="background-color:#C9D6EC"><span class="h3" style="font-size:20px">Audit stratégique</span><svg class="chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6 L8 11 L13 6" fill="none" stroke="#4A2018" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mbody dots" style="background-color:#C9D6EC">
          <div class="sheet" style="gap:12px;padding-bottom:16px">
            <p class="small">Je passe votre communication à la loupe pour comprendre ce qui marche et ce qui bloque, puis je vous remets un plan d'action concret et priorisé.</p>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Ce que je fais</p>
            <ul class="stars-list"><li>Analyse de l'existant</li><li>Benchmark</li><li>Plan d'action</li></ul>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Idéal si…</p>
            <p class="note" style="font-size:20px">vous avez l'impression de communiquer sans résultats</p>
            <div style="align-self:flex-start;filter:drop-shadow(3px 4px 0 rgba(74,32,24,.18));transform:rotate(-2deg);margin:4px 0 6px"><div class="ptag kraft"><span class="tag-hole"></span><span class="spec" style="font-weight:700">à partir de</span><span class="serif" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.1">500 €</span></div></div>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services/audit-strategique/">Découvrir le service</a>
            <a class="link" href="/portfolio/" style="font-size:12px">Voir les projets →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="mfolder" id="m-graphisme" data-dossier="graphisme" data-anim="rise">
        <summary>
          <span class="ear dots" style="left:92px;background-color:#EFC9D2">03 · Graphisme</span>
          <span class="bar dots" style="background-color:#EFC9D2"><span class="h3" style="font-size:20px">Graphisme print et digital</span><svg class="chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6 L8 11 L13 6" fill="none" stroke="#4A2018" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mbody dots" style="background-color:#EFC9D2">
          <div class="sheet" style="gap:12px;padding-bottom:16px">
            <p class="small">Je réalise vos supports print et digital à partir de votre logo et de vos couleurs, de la carte de visite au template Instagram.</p>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Ce que je fais</p>
            <ul class="stars-list"><li>Supports print (flyer, carte de visite, étiquette, stickers…)</li><li>Templates réseaux sociaux</li><li>Templates mail et documents</li></ul>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Idéal si…</p>
            <p class="note" style="font-size:20px">vos supports manquent de cohérence</p>
            <div style="align-self:flex-start;filter:drop-shadow(3px 4px 0 rgba(74,32,24,.18));transform:rotate(-2deg);margin:4px 0 6px"><div class="ptag kraft"><span class="tag-hole"></span><span class="spec" style="font-weight:700">à partir de</span><span class="serif" style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.1">60 €</span></div></div>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services/graphisme/">Découvrir le service</a>
            <a class="link" href="/portfolio/" style="font-size:12px">Voir les projets →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="mfolder" id="m-redac" data-dossier="redac" data-anim="rise">
        <summary>
          <span class="ear dots" style="left:138px;background-color:#CFE3C4">04 · Rédac</span>
          <span class="bar dots" style="background-color:#CFE3C4"><span class="h3" style="font-size:20px">Rédactionnel</span><svg class="chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6 L8 11 L13 6" fill="none" stroke="#4A2018" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="mbody dots" style="background-color:#CFE3C4">
          <div class="sheet" style="gap:12px;padding-bottom:16px">
            <p class="small">J'écris vos articles de blog, vos newsletters et vos communiqués de presse, pensés pour vos lecteurs… et pour Google.</p>
            <p class="label" style="font-size:10px">Ce que je fais</p>
